/harness
*.test
*.out
.DS_Store
__pycache__/

# rapid property-test failure seeds are local reproduction artifacts, never
# committed. The pattern is anchored with **/ because rapid writes these
# under a package's OWN testdata/rapid/ dir (e.g. message/testdata/rapid/),
# not only at the repo root -- a bare "testdata/rapid/" only matches the
# root, since a slash inside a gitignore pattern anchors it to the
# .gitignore's own directory.
**/testdata/rapid/
